# Screenshots taken while checking a UI change. Useful in the moment, and they
# are pictures of a real workspace's resource names.
.screenshots/

# Policy tests captured from a real scan. Each one is a resource document from
# somebody's production estate, named after their catalogs and volumes, so these
# are local to whoever pressed Capture and are never committed. Promoting one
# (Testing → Captures → Promote) scrubs the names and writes a new file into
# backend/fixtures/synthetic/, which is the committed set.
backend/fixtures/captured/*
!backend/fixtures/captured/README.md
